==== GL.iNet Web Upgrade Process ====

  * Browse to ''<nowiki>http://192.168.8.1/#/upgrade</nowiki>'' GL.iNet Web Upgrade URL
  * Upload image file for sysupgrade
  * Choose whether to keep the configuration according to your needs, the default is to keep the configuration
  * Click install
  * Wait for reboot

==== LuCI Web Upgrade Process ====

  * Browse to ''<nowiki>http://192.168.8.1/cgi-bin/luci/admin/system/flash</nowiki>'' LuCI Upgrade URL
  * Upload image file for sysupgrade to LuCI
  * Wait for reboot

==== Terminal Upgrade Process ====
If you don't have a GUI (LuCI) available, you can alternatively upgrade via the command line.

Note: It is important that you put the firmware image into the ramdisk (/tmp) before you start flashing.

  * Login as root via SSH on 192.168.8.1, then enter the following commands:

<code>
cd /tmp
wget http://download.gl-inet.com/firmware/x750/release/openwrt-x750-3.203-0701.bin
sysupgrade /tmp/openwrt-x750-3.203-0701.bin
</code>

