==== USB Port ====

The USB 2.0 serial port is not enabled by default. To enable it GPIO2 must be set to low.
The following sequence should do it:

<code>
echo 514 >/sys/class/gpio/export
echo out >/sys/class/gpio/gpio514/direction
echo 0 >/sys/class/gpio/gpio514/value
</code>

